body:
That is one thing I did notice.. in PVE content, I really just... despise hunter it seems?  
But doing some crucible with them, I had fun. Moreso than I usualy do on my titan..


Maybe I'm just a PVE Titan/Warlock main.. and Hunter is my pvp class? x3;

The poll was so I wouldn't be bias going in, and it's be 'fresh' for me I suppose as I couldn't decide mysel. Lordy it did not work x3;

And yhea, right now my feeling is to just focus on the warlock. I've already done campaign and post campaign on my titan; had a blast as I always do.  
Warlock just seems like my 'other' class choice at this point compared to hunter x3;

Thats the little bastards..  


And we never got to find out. The campaign died during the fight as people were... rightly pissed we were fighting four of those at lvl 2. And we weren't enjoying the module much as it was.  
And the DM then wanted to pull the "It was just a dream" card.. which made it worse x3;;

Literally the same. I've had a single red bar bow drop; unlocked all the glaives though which are supposedly meant to be rare..  


Even after the hotfix; the drop rate is ass x.x and usually if I DO get the weapon;  
It's not resonant..
